<div class="container-fluid center-text">
  <div class="row" style="background-color: #1d2e3a;">
    <div class="col-3"
         id="home-view-header">
      <%= image_tag squakjive_avatar_url(size: "60x60"), class: "img-fluid", alt: "SquakJive" %>

    </div>

    <div class="col-6 text-center">
      <h1>
        SquakJive
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="col-3 d-flex justify-content-end align-items-center">
      <%= link_to "Sign up", new_user_registration_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg me-2" %>
      <%= link_to "Log in", new_user_session_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg" %>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="row justify-content-center py-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-10 px-4">

      <p class="lead text-center mb-4">
        A personal, very small micro chat streaming service — just for the people you actually know.
      </p>

      <p class="text-center text-secondary mb-5">
        SquakJive is not a social network. It is a quiet corner of the internet where you and a handful
        of family and friends can share short messages in real time, without algorithms, ads, or strangers.
      </p>

      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 text-center p-4">
            <div class="display-6 mb-3">①</div>
            <h3 class="h5">Create circles</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 text-secondary">
              Start by creating a circle — a small group for your family, close friends, or anyone you want
              to stay in touch with.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 text-center p-4">
            <div class="display-6 mb-3">②</div>
            <h3 class="h5">Add people</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 text-secondary">
              Invite users into each circle. Only the people you add can see and join that circle's
              conversation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 text-center p-4">
            <div class="display-6 mb-3">③</div>
            <h3 class="h5">Squak together</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 text-secondary">
              Post short messages — squaks — that stream live to everyone in the circle. Small groups,
              simple chat, no noise.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center">
        <%= link_to "Get started — it's free", new_user_registration_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>